  "title": "Aamal in Jumada al-Akhirah",
  "data": "At any time in Jumada al-Akhirah, offer a four-unit prayer, two units at a time:\nIn the first unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) is recited once, [Ayat al-Kursi](A4) once, and [Surah al-Qadr](A101) repeated twenty-five times.\nIn the second unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) is recited once, [Surah al-Takathur](A106) (No. 102) once, and [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) repeated twenty-five times.\nIn the third unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) is recited once, [Surah al-Kafirun](A113) (No. 109) once, and [Surah al-Falaq](A117) (No. 113) repeated twenty-five times.\nIn the fourth unit, [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) is recited once, [Surah al-Nasr](A114) (No. 110) once, and [Surah al-Nas](A118) (No. 114) repeated twenty-five times.\nAfter the four units, repeat 70 times:\nسُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ وَ الْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ وَ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَ اللّٰهُ اَكْبَرُ\nSUBHAANAL LAAHI WAL HAMDU LILLAAHI WA LAA ILAAHA ILLAL LAAHU WAL LAAHU AKBAR\nAll glory be to Allah, all praise be to Allah, there is no god save Allah, and Allah is the Greatest.\nYou may also repeat 7 times:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad.\nAfter that, repeat 3 times:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْفِرْ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nALLAAHUMMAGHFIR LILMU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT\nO Allah, (please do) forgive the believing men and women.\nAfter that, prostrate and repeat 3 times:\nيَا حَيُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ يَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَ الْاِكْرَامِ يَا اَللّٰهُ يَا رَحْمَانُ يَا رَحِيْمُ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nYAA HAYYU YAA QAYYOOMU YAA ZAL JALAALI WAL IKRAAMI YAA ALLAAHU YAA RAHMAANU YAA RAHEEMU YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nO Ever-living! O Self-Subsisting! O Lord of majesty and honor! O All-beneficent! O All-merciful! O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!\nThen pray to Almighty Allah for your needs.",
  "merits": "Sayyid Ibn Tawus has mentioned this prayer for any time in the month of Jumada al-Akhirah.\n\nIf one does all this, he, as well as his property, wife, sons, religion, and worldly affairs, will be saved up to the next year. If he dies during that year, he will be rewarded as martyred."
